## 🏗️ Recommended Tech Stack (Hackathon-Optimized)

| Layer | Tech | Why |
|-------|------|-----|
| **Frontend** | Next.js + React | Fast setup, SSR, file-based routing |
| **Styling** | Tailwind CSS | Rapid UI development |
| **Charts** | Recharts or Chart.js | Quick dashboards |
| **Maps** | Leaflet + OpenStreetMap | Free, no API key needed |
| **Backend** | Next.js API Routes | No separate server needed |
| **Database** | SQLite (via Prisma) or Supabase | Zero-config DB |
| **AI/LLM** | OpenAI GPT-4 / Gemini API | AI Agent reasoning, NLP, risk analysis |
| **OCR** | Tesseract.js (browser) | Client-side OCR, no server needed |
| **Auth** | NextAuth.js | Role-based login in minutes |
| **File Upload** | Multer or UploadThing | Photo/document evidence |
| **Geo** | Browser Geolocation API | GPS coordinates from device |

