## 🎤 Demo Script (5-Minute Pitch)

1. **"A field inspector at Mine X discovers a safety hazard"** → Show mobile form with photo + GPS
2. **"The system automatically detects a violation"** → Show AI classification
3. **"Our AI Agent investigates and recommends action"** → Show the 6-step reasoning
4. **"Task is auto-assigned with escalation"** → Show workflow engine
5. **"Corrective action is submitted and AI-verified"** → Show CAPA flow
6. **"All stakeholders see real-time status"** → Switch between 3 dashboards
7. **"Everything is auditable and tamper-proof"** → Show audit trail
8. **"AI predicts which mines need attention next"** → Show risk heatmap

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The demo story matters more than feature count. Build one end-to-end flow perfectly rather than many half-built features.

